98
00:07:13,211 --> 00:07:14,011
Huh?

99
00:07:23,011 --> 00:07:23,631
Uh-oh.

100
00:07:27,131 --> 00:07:28,991
It's winter wolf sting underground!

101
00:07:43,211 --> 00:07:51,551
