102
00:07:51,891 --> 00:07:52,991
He's covered in blood.

103
00:08:00,991 --> 00:08:01,591
Before...

104
00:08:01,591 --> 00:08:02,211
I...

105
00:08:02,211 --> 00:08:03,211
I...

106
00:08:03,211 --> 00:08:05,771
I tried to warn you,

107
00:08:05,851 --> 00:08:06,951
but you wouldn't listen!

108
00:08:07,431 --> 00:08:09,311
Running is the only answer!

109
00:08:09,311 --> 00:08:11,531
I'm sorry, Strawboy.

110
00:08:11,611 --> 00:08:12,351
I'm a coward.

111
00:08:12,811 --> 00:08:13,831
Forgive me!

112
00:08:14,531 --> 00:08:15,671
I ran away.

113
00:08:18,831 --> 00:08:19,731
Hey, pal.

114
00:08:20,271 --> 00:08:21,471
How do you...

115
00:08:21,471 --> 00:08:22,011
know him?

116
00:08:27,651 --> 00:08:29,211
He's my friend!

117
00:08:30,891 --> 00:08:31,451
Strawboy!

118
00:08:31,891 --> 00:08:34,031
I'm not letting you die!

119
00:08:34,031 --> 00:08:37,671
Come on!

120
00:08:37,911 --> 00:08:38,771
We better go!

121
00:08:47,771 --> 00:08:51,291
