122
00:08:51,951 --> 00:08:55,331
I never thought about breaking out of here until now.

123
00:08:55,331 --> 00:09:01,831
I gotta find Eva before it's too late!

124
00:09:02,751 --> 00:09:03,631
Eva, huh?

125
00:09:04,071 --> 00:09:06,571
I have no idea where that Twinkle Toes went.

126
00:09:07,031 --> 00:09:09,031
