127
00:09:12,751 --> 00:09:14,351
Emporio Ivankov.

128
00:09:15,031 --> 00:09:16,051
Oh, that guy.

129
00:09:16,491 --> 00:09:16,791
Yeah.

130
00:09:17,891 --> 00:09:19,111
