145
00:09:54,091 --> 00:09:55,551
How about you, then?

146
00:09:56,071 --> 00:09:56,451
Yeah.

147
00:09:56,891 --> 00:09:57,611
I heard ya.

148
00:09:58,091 --> 00:09:59,731
