149
00:10:00,251 --> 00:10:00,511
Right?

150
00:10:00,771 --> 00:10:01,071
Yeah.

151
00:10:01,331 --> 00:10:02,091
Do you know something?

152
00:10:02,471 --> 00:10:03,031
Look.

153
00:10:03,171 --> 00:10:03,731
Over there.

154
00:10:04,071 --> 00:10:05,071
You see that forest?

155
00:10:05,431 --> 00:10:05,871
Yes.

156
00:10:06,531 --> 00:10:08,151
There's an abandoned jailhouse.

157
00:10:08,591 --> 00:10:09,911
Way beyond the tree line.

158
00:10:10,851 --> 00:10:11,571
A while back,

159
00:10:11,871 --> 00:10:13,451
