161
00:10:15,751 --> 00:10:16,231
Really?

162
00:10:16,231 --> 00:10:18,051
Yeah, I think it was him.

163
00:10:18,351 --> 00:10:19,131
It's worth a look.

164
00:10:21,811 --> 00:10:22,811
Thanks, friend.

165
00:10:23,291 --> 00:10:24,631
We're all in this together.

166
00:10:25,951 --> 00:10:26,931
That forest.

167
00:10:27,291 --> 00:10:29,231
It's where the wolves live.

168
00:10:29,391 --> 00:10:30,031
Oh, is it?

169
00:10:30,031 --> 00:10:44,171
Every so often, people disappear in Impel Town.

170
00:10:44,671 --> 00:10:46,651
We're sure they didn't just break out,

171
00:10:46,891 --> 00:10:48,751
as some of the missing could barely move.

172
00:10:49,331 --> 00:10:50,811
They just vanished without a trace,

173
00:10:50,931 --> 00:10:52,291
and no one seems to know the cause.

174
00:10:52,291 --> 00:10:55,011
We've come to call it demon-ing away.

175
00:10:56,511 --> 00:10:58,291
All the guards here have come to fear

176
00:10:58,291 --> 00:11:00,331
