00:18:42,251 --> 00:18:43,251
I'll seat you.

279
00:18:43,251 --> 00:18:45,251
What floor did you come from, by the way?

280
00:18:46,251 --> 00:18:47,251
We've got plenty to eat here.

281
00:18:48,251 --> 00:18:49,251
I'd guess you're hungry.

282
00:18:50,251 --> 00:18:51,251
Wait!

283
00:18:51,251 --> 00:18:52,251
Where am I?

284
00:18:52,251 --> 00:18:53,251
Where's Strawboy?

285
00:18:53,251 --> 00:18:54,251
What?

286
00:18:54,251 --> 00:18:55,251
What?

287
00:18:55,251 --> 00:18:57,251
Do you think you somehow magically made it out of the prison?

288
00:18:58,251 --> 00:18:59,251
Don't worry.

289
00:18:59,251 --> 00:19:01,251
You're still an impel down, sweetie.

290
00:19:02,251 --> 00:19:03,251
No way!

291
00:19:03,251 --> 00:19:04,251
That's a lie!

292
00:19:04,251 --> 00:19:06,251
No one's wearing any prison clothes!

293
00:19:06,251 --> 00:19:07,251
Everyone's drinking and having fun!

294
00:19:07,251 --> 00:19:09,251
Did I wake up in some kind of paradise?

295
00:19:09,251 --> 00:19:10,251
What's the deal?

296
00:19:11,251 --> 00:19:12,251
Hold on.

297
00:19:12,251 --> 00:19:13,251
I remember.

298
00:19:13,251 --> 00:19:17,251
I was chased down and attacked by those wolves.

299
00:19:17,251 --> 00:19:19,251
Then Strawboy woke up and helped me.

300
00:19:19,251 --> 00:19:20,251
After that, I passed out.

301
00:19:23,251 --> 00:19:25,251
Then maybe I am dreaming.

302
00:19:26,251 --> 00:19:27,251
Oh, wait!

303
00:19:27,251 --> 00:19:30,251
What if I died from the cold and I'm in heaven now?

304
00:19:31,251 --> 00:19:33,251
Close, but no cigar.

305
00:19:33,251 --> 00:19:34,251
Huh?

306
00:19:34,251 --> 00:19:36,251
You've been sleeping like a baby.

307
00:19:36,251 --> 00:19:38,251
Out cold for ten hours now.

308
00:19:38,251 --> 00:19:39,251
Ten hours?

309
00:19:39,251 --> 00:19:40,251
Are you kidding me?

310
00:19:40,251 --> 00:19:41,251
