314
00:19:46,251 --> 00:19:49,251
I'm the one who fetched you from that bitter cold, after all.

315
00:19:49,251 --> 00:19:51,251
You're lucky you two didn't die from exposure.

316
00:19:51,251 --> 00:19:52,251
Wait!

317
00:19:52,251 --> 00:19:54,251
