329
00:20:16,251 --> 00:20:17,251
It's time!

330
00:20:17,251 --> 00:20:18,251
The show's starting!

331
00:20:18,251 --> 00:20:20,251
You'll want a front row seat.

332
00:20:20,251 --> 00:20:21,251
What is this?

333
00:20:21,251 --> 00:20:35,251
Did you sleep tight, little candy boy?

334
00:20:35,251 --> 00:20:40,251
Or should I say, little bum boy?

335
00:20:40,251 --> 00:20:43,251
How do you know my name?

336
00:20:43,251 --> 00:20:48,251
Oh, thank you for coming.

337
00:20:48,251 --> 00:20:50,251
