338
00:20:50,251 --> 00:20:51,251
Yeah!

339
00:20:51,251 --> 00:20:52,251
Yeah!

340
00:20:52,251 --> 00:20:53,251
Shaker!

341
00:20:53,251 --> 00:20:54,251
Dixie!

342
00:20:54,251 --> 00:21:01,251
To get here, you have to pass through the sewers of Impel Down.

343
00:21:01,251 --> 00:21:09,251
Following paths that shouldn't exist to a place beyond imagination.

344
00:21:09,251 --> 00:21:12,251
It's a prisoner's paradise.

345
00:21:16,251 --> 00:21:20,251
We've got every pleasure you could ever beg for right here.

346
00:21:21,251 --> 00:21:22,251
Drinks.

347
00:21:23,251 --> 00:21:24,251
Weapons.

348
00:21:26,251 --> 00:21:27,251
Games.

349
00:21:27,251 --> 00:21:31,251
But most of all, we have freedom!

350
00:21:31,251 --> 00:21:32,251
Yeah!

351
00:21:32,251 --> 00:21:33,251
You said it!

352
00:21:33,251 --> 00:21:35,251
We got our freedom!

353
00:21:36,251 --> 00:21:39,251
Looks like the jailers are flipping their tops again.

354
00:21:40,251 --> 00:21:42,251
Prisoners have disappeared.

355
00:21:42,251 --> 00:21:44,251
They've been pulled down into hell.

356
00:21:44,251 --> 00:21:47,251
Those silly little fools couldn't be more wrong.

357
00:21:47,251 --> 00:21:50,251
We're here and we're queer!

358
00:21:50,251 --> 00:21:51,251
Woo!

359
00:21:51,251 --> 00:21:52,251
Woo!

360
00:21:52,251 --> 00:21:53,251
Woo!

361
00:21:53,251 --> 00:21:54,251
Woo!

362
00:21:54,251 --> 00:21:55,251
Woo!

363
00:21:55,251 --> 00:21:56,251
Woo!

364
00:21:56,251 --> 00:21:59,251
I wouldn't exactly call this hell, would you?

365
00:21:59,251 --> 00:22:00,251
Woo!

366
00:22:00,251 --> 00:22:01,251
Woo!

367
00:22:01,251 --> 00:22:02,251
Well, who knows?

368
00:22:02,251 --> 00:22:03,251
Maybe it is.

369
00:22:03,251 --> 00:22:05,251
But if so, at least it's a gay one.

370
00:22:06,251 --> 00:22:09,251
The secret underground where dreams come true.

371
00:22:09,251 --> 00:22:10,251
Woo!

372
00:22:10,251 --> 00:22:12,251
I bid you welcome.

373
00:22:16,251 --> 00:22:19,251
To Impel Down level 5.5, bitches!

374
00:22:19,251 --> 00:22:22,251
