375
00:22:22,251 --> 00:22:23,251
Ah!

376
00:22:23,251 --> 00:22:26,251
This is New Kamaland!

377
00:22:26,251 --> 00:22:28,251
Hee-haw!

378
00:22:32,251 --> 00:22:35,251
They're all queer like me.

379
